---
// PRIVATE preview to compare the two Christmas animations (noindex, not linked anywhere).
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import SantaFlyover from "../components/SantaFlyover.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Santa preview" description="Preview" canonical="https://fatehplumelec.com/santa-preview.html" noindex={true}>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="sp-wrap">
    <h1>🎅 Christmas animation preview</h1>
    <p>Two choices. Watch both, then tell me <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>both</strong>.</p>

    <div class="sp-card">
      <h2>A · In the header (live now)</h2>
      <p>Santa and the reindeer fly left to right behind the menu at the top, over and over, where the van used to drive. Look at the top of this page.</p>
      <div class="sp-actions"><button class="button secondary" type="button" id="sp-toggle-a">Hide A / Show A</button></div>
    </div>

    <div class="sp-card">
      <h2>B · Sweeps across the screen</h2>
      <p>Every 45 seconds Santa comes in from the bottom-left, swoops up and flies out to the top-right, then disappears. On this page he flies every 15 seconds so you don't have to wait.</p>
      <div class="sp-actions"><button class="button" type="button" onclick="window.santaFly && window.santaFly()">▶ Play B now</button></div>
    </div>

    <p class="sp-note">Both turn off automatically after midnight on December 31. The van comes back on January 1.</p>
  </main>
  <SantaFlyover everySeconds={15} firstAfter={3} />
  <SiteFooter />
  <script is:inline>
    document.getElementById("sp-toggle-a").addEventListener("click", function () { document.documentElement.classList.toggle("season-santa"); });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
<style is:global>
  .sp-wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 80px; }
  .sp-wrap h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); }
  .sp-card { margin: 18px 0; padding: 20px 22px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--white); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .sp-card h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .sp-actions { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .sp-note { color: var(--muted); }
</style>
